    "A clean, plain-language summary you can hand to a non-technical reader — counsel, a manager. Copy or print it." : {

    },
    "A complete, append-only record of what happened to your data — every file acquisition and integrity check, and every human decision. Nothing here is editable or deletable; it is the receipt for the ledger." : {

    },
    "A corrections path exists after publishing (pinned comment / description edit / erratum)" : {

    },
    "A corrections path exists post-publication" : {

    },
    "A deviation resolves the rule as an authorized departure and downgrades the sealed status to 'conformant with deviations'. Prohibitions are non-waivable — a deviation on one fails the run. Every departure stays on the certificate with who authorized it and why." : {

    },
    "A fact confirmed a year ago may no longer hold. Flagging the oldest confirmations keeps them from being reused as if freshly checked — the difference between a current answer and a confidently wrong one." : {

    },
    "A finding can be right on the evidence yet fail if the process was unfair — confirm both fairness steps." : {

    },
    "A focused, evidence-cited history of one subject — resolved to a canonical identity." : {

    },
    "A folder anyone can verify without Investigation Docs Made Easy — integrity, authenticity and conformance replay (spec: BUNDLE_FORMAT.md; CLI: kalverify)." : {

    },
    "A large email dump, made navigable — exact duplicates removed and scattered replies grouped into conversations, most-recently-active first." : {

    },
    "A matter is the container all jobs run against (a case, story, research question, or personal topic). Name it, pick the workspace holding its documents, and start." : {

    },
    "A one-shot file converter — nothing here is saved to your knowledge base. Reads PDF, Word, Excel, images (OCR), email/PST/NSF, and audio & video (transcribed); exports to text, Markdown, JSON, HTML, CSV, PDF, RTF, Word, Excel, or PNG." : {

    },
    "A patent number, a person, a company, a project. The app gathers everything it extracted about it into one cited, chronological file — overview, parties, timeline, clauses, roadblocks, and what's still missing." : {

    },
    "A re-parse of the output found none of the protected terms in its extractable text. Save it above." : {

    },
    "A signed receipt (.receipt.json) is written beside every export, one entry per row, so anyone can check the file was not changed." : {

    },
    "A top-k gate runs specialist “super-experts” (Analyst, Skeptic, Historian, Connector, Quant) in parallel and folds their perspectives into the answer. Highest quality; adds several model passes (slower)." : {

    },
